 ==== Overview
 
 The AXI Aggregator ([.monospaced]#++AOU_AGGREGATOR++#) combines narrow read and write data into full-width bus beats to improve bus utilization. It sits downstream of the xref:aou-axi-transaction-splitter[AXI Transaction Splitter] and is the last processing stage before the AXI manager port inside [.monospaced]#++AOU_AXI4MUX_3X1_TOP++#. One instance exists per RP.
